# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# prefs: volumes-on
# PVN-058: the Disks icon follows its setting.  Nothing added or removed it
# when the setting changed, so turning it off left it on the Desktop until
# something else happened to rebuild the listing.
wait 12
expect-desk-icon Boot
note turned off in the preferences, it goes at once
key comma ctrl
wait 5
click 432 202
wait 3
key Escape
wait 12
expect-no-desk-icon Boot
expect-desk-icon notes.txt
quit
